    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this bright and spacious two-bedroom semi-detached dormer bungalow to the market, ideally positioned in the ever-popular Forest Crescent development in Swords, Co. Dublin. No. 32 comes to the market offering well-proportioned living accommodation throughout together with a large rear garden and enormous potential to create a fantastic family home. This superb property is sure to appeal to a wide range of buyers including first-time purchasers, investors and those looking to downsize.\n\nThe location is second to none, situated in the heart of Swords and within easy reach of every conceivable amenity including The Pavilions Shopping Centre, Airside Retail Park, excellent primary and secondary schools, sports clubs, parks and leisure facilities. Dublin Airport, the M1 and M50 motorways are all easily accessible while numerous bus routes provide convenient access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas.\n\nBright and well laid out internal living accommodation of approximately 72 sq.m. comprises of entrance hallway, spacious living room, fully fitted kitchen, ground floor bedroom and family bathroom. Upstairs you will find a large second bedroom with fitted wardrobes and additional storage space.\n\nNo. 32 comes to the market in good condition throughout and benefits from gas fired central heating, bright and airy living accommodation and a private driveway to the front. One of the standout features of this property is the substantial rear garden which offers excellent outdoor space together with obvious potential to extend further subject to the necessary planning permission. A detached garden shed provides additional storage space.\n\nThis is an ideal opportunity for any buyer seeking a well-located home in one of North Dublin's most established and sought-after residential areas. Early viewing is highly advised. Contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today on 0868323302 or 015411455 to arrange a viewing.\n\nKey Features\n• BER E2\n• c.72 sq.m.\n• 2 Bed / 1 Bath Semi-Detached Dormer Bungalow\n• Asking Price 375,000\n• Gas fired central heating\n• Bright and spacious living accommodation\n• Large living room with feature fireplace\n• Fully fitted kitchen\n• Fitted wardrobes\n• Private driveway parking\n• Large rear garden\n• Detached garden shed\n• Excellent potential to extend (S.P.P.)\n• Mature and highly sought-after location\n• Close to Swords Village, Airside and The Pavilions Shopping Centre\n• Easy access to Dublin Airport, M1 and M50 motorways\n• Excellent transport links nearby\n• Ideal for first-time buyers, investors and downsizers\n• Viewing highly advised"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Sales Team 14"
      }
